  "overall_description": "MobileIE employs a streamlined topology with deployable operators, decoupling training and inference phases. It uses MBRConv for multi-scale feature capture, FST for nonlinear feature interactions, and HDPA for fusing global and local features, re-parameterizing into standard convolution during inference.",
